Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.97,0:01:00.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,地球 人类生命的发源地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Earth. Birth place of the human race.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.14,0:01:04.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,人类与我们大致相近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A species much like our own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.91,0:01:08.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,既心怀仁慈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Capable of great compassion...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.50,0:01:10.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(公元前17000年)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.41,0:01:12.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亦残忍暴虐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and great violence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.10,0:01:26.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在保护人类时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For in our quest to protect the humans,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.60,0:01:29.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,揭开了一些尘封的往事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a deeper revelation dawns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.85,0:01:33.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,原来我们与人类早已相识\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our worlds have met before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.32,0:01:45.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这儿 这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.63,0:02:13.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,《变形金刚2：卷土重来》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.94,0:02:17.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(中国上海 当日22点14分)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.41,0:02:20.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,BBC新闻快报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Newsflash from the BBC.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.31,0:02:21.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,发生在上海的爆炸性新闻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Breaking news at Shanghai.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.98,0:02:23.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上海市中心今日发生严重的...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's been a major toxic spill...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.68,0:02:25.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有毒物质泄漏事件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on the Shanghai Central District.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.38,0:02:26.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 市民们... - 今天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Citizens today... - For today,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.46,0:02:28.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会为大家关注事件的发展\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}our topic that's a developing story for you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.42,0:02:30.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一旦有新的进展\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we will bring you any new information{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.41,0:02:31.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,会立刻告诉大家...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as we get it...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.96,0:02:35.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(五角大楼 NEST部队指挥部)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.95,0:02:38.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 情况怎么样? - 海鹰正接近目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's the status? - C-hawks approaching target.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.07,0:02:41.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,完成疏散还有三分钟 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three minutes until evacuation's complete, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.26,0:02:45.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,中国领空已实施封锁 方圆一英里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chinese airspace has been locked and sealed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.77,0:02:46.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在开始行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One mile radius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.76,0:02:48.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 NEST部队准备好开始行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright, give NEST team the go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.57,0:02:50.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,黑鹰 可以着陆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Black Hawks, clear to land.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.79,0:02:54.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,叮铃铃叮铃铃 出来拿你的冰淇淋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ding-a-ling, come out and get your ice cream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.50,0:02:59.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,霸天虎都给我听好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any bad robot out there better...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.40,0:03:01.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等着被我打屁股吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}get ready for ass-whooping.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.42,0:03:04.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(霸天虎 舔屁股)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.12,0:03:08.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,过去两年里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the last two years,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.80,0:03:10.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一支新的汽车人先遣队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}an advanced team of new Autobots...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.97,0:03:13.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来到地球避难 并加入我的麾下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has taken refuge here under my command.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.67,0:03:15.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿尔茜双胞胎 准备出发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arcees, get ready to launch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.18,0:03:17.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们锁定目标并着陆了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're locked and loaded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.82,0:03:21.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们大家一起与人类结为盟友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Together, we form an alliance with the humans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.95,0:03:25.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们是一群勇敢的无名英雄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A secret, a brave squad of soldiers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.18,0:03:26.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 听好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright, that's enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.16,0:03:28.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,媒体报道说是有毒物质泄漏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time discovered story in this one is toxic spill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.28,0:03:30.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是为了疏散人群进行搜救\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They had to evac the area for search and rescue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.49,0:03:33.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,八个月内我们已对敌人作战六次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This makes six enemy contacts in eight months.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.15,0:03:34.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这次行动决不能...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta make sure this one does not...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.70,0:03:36.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让公众知道 所以务必要保密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}get out the public axe so keep it tight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.51,0:03:40.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这支秘密部队代号为NEST\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A classified strike team called NEST.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.68,0:03:44.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,作战目标锁定我们汽车人的死敌霸天虎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We hunt for what remains of our Decepticon foes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.34,0:03:47.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,突袭霸天虎在全球各地的巢穴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}hiding in different countries around the globe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.40,0:03:49.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,马上穿越E区前往A区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rolling Alpha through Echo now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.59,0:04:18.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 铁皮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright, Ironhide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.67,0:04:22.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们到达E区 走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got Echo's. Vamos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.55,0:04:24.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,防守两点钟方向区域\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To the stacks. Two o'clock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.88,0:04:36.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.34,0:04:39.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我闻到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I smell him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.85,0:04:45.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,接近了 快接近了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's close. It's heading closer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.67,0:04:51.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.92,0:04:53.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How are ya?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.68,0:04:55.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有放射线存在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's three ripple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.74,0:04:59.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 大家都保持警惕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright, everybody, be steady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.58,0:05:00.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它就在前面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're right on top of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.77,0:05:13.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,注意火力方向\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ease on fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.21,0:05:33.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,黑豹一号 请求立即支援火力!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hand to one. Requesting fire mission now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.41,0:05:35.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,直升机已就位 马上赶到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gunships on station. Rolling hot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.43,0:05:47.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们又发现一个霸天虎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We intersected a Decepticon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.77,0:05:53.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿尔茜 双胞胎 目标朝你们来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arcee twins, target coming your way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.10,0:05:59.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小心!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.02,0:06:33.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我搞砸了 还好 没大碍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I screwed that up. I'm okay, I'm alright.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.21,0:06:36.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这可是战场 你搞什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is kinda bad, man.What's wrong with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.22,0:06:41.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快让横炮上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three insides white.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.96,0:06:45.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,干净 迅速\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clear and fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.10,0:07:02.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈的 我真棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn, I'm good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.00,0:07:13.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,空中支援\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Air support,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.00,0:07:15.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在就让运输机把他空降下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we need Big Booter delivered and dropped now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.28,0:07:16.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,密码 9-A...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Code 9-A...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.36,0:07:22.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,下降倒数 五 四 三 二 一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dropping in five, four, three, two, one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.39,0:07:38.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,汽车人 让我来对付那家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Autobots, I'm in pursuit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.31,0:08:08.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还不快停下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.45,0:08:31.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,弱不禁风的霸天虎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Punk-ass Decepticon,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.51,0:08:34.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有什么遗言吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}any last words?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.25,0:08:37.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个星球不是你们的地盘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is not your planet to rule.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.06,0:08:40.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,堕落金刚会东山再起的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Fallen shall rise again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.22,0:08:43.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看来会有麻烦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That doesn't sound good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.86,0:08:45.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但今天不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.00,0:08:53.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快点 该走了 都出来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, let's go. All hands on deck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.36,0:08:54.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,弗兰克 魔球 出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frankie, Mojo, out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.88,0:08:55.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快点 孩子们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, kiddo,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.60,0:08:56.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们赶时间 - 慢点 老爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- we're on a schedule here. - Slow down, Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.00,0:08:58.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老爸 你这么着急赶我走干吗 嗯?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you in such a hurry to get rid of me, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.67,0:08:59.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你把房间租出去了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you rent the room out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.92,0:09:01.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没 不过我倒很想把你那房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I got other ideas for your room{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.71,0:09:03.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,改造成家庭影院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and it rhymes with home theater.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.64,0:09:12.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看我找到了什么 你小时候的婴儿鞋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look what I found. It's your little baby booties.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.76,0:09:14.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 老妈...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Ma...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.57,0:09:18.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的宝贝儿子 儿子 你不能走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh my little baby, booty boy, you can't go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.29,0:09:18.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看到了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.69,0:09:19.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是你们该有的反应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's how you're supposed to react{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.80,0:09:21.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亲儿子就要踏入社会了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when you free your loins does not...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.36,0:09:22.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就没有点同情心吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}uncool the world to pep for himself, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.96,0:09:24.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,行 你上大学...我痛不欲生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, my heart...Please treat it about college,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.50,0:09:25.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,郁闷!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}bummer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.45,0:09:28.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,记得常回家看看 任何假期都要回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to come home every holiday,{\r}
