Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.25,0:38:03.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,万物流离失所\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whole generations lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.14,0:38:10.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道 我... 我想帮助你 真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know and I...I want to help you. I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.50,0:38:12.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我不是你们驻地球的大使\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I'm not some alien ambassador.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.45,0:38:15.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道 我只是一个普通人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I'm a normal kid with normal problems.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.45,0:38:18.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我做我该做的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am where I'm supposed to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.49,0:38:22.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 我...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.70,0:38:25.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I really am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.81,0:38:27.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,山姆 我们不能指望天意...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam, fate rarely calls upon us...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.82,0:38:29.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来改变自己的命运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at a moment of our choosing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.65,0:38:33.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是无敌的擎天柱 你不需要我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're Optimus Prime. You don't need me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.34,0:38:37.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要你... 只是你不知道而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We do... more than you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.35,0:38:42.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(北大西洋 早上7时13分)
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.29,0:39:12.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(美国船舶 特贝卡 SSN-754)
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.25,0:39:15.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,方向2-1-4 有可疑目标接近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}New contact, bearing 214 and possible hostile{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.39,0:39:17.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,威震天在深海所处位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}confirmed for Project Beat Six drop-point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.56,0:39:19.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 怎么样了? - 有五个目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What you got? - Sue, pull five contacts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.41,0:39:21.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,已迅速潜至水下五千英尺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}5, 000 feet. Diving fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.70,0:39:27.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我从没见过下潜这么快的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's something.They dive that deep, that fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.89,0:39:29.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,进入战斗状态\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man battle stations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.00,0:39:30.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,传令 进入战斗状态\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sealer One, man battle stations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.48,0:39:33.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快 左满舵 速度三分之二\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hell, not pull the rudder or head two-thirds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.76,0:39:35.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,下潜 下潜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dive, Cookie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.47,0:40:00.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,检测到敌方正发出声纳 上官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The NEST protecting NBE-1 are screening, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.64,0:40:02.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,此处深达九千三百英寻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is 9, 300 fathoms down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.77,0:40:05.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 没有深潜器能赶到现场吗? - 没有 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And no confirmed DSRVs on sight? - None, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.28,0:40:07.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么 各位 麻烦大了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then, people, we've got a problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.90,0:40:18.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,需要零件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Need parts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.44,0:40:21.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拆掉最小的那个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill such little one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.46,0:40:30.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有碎片就有能量晶体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sea shard, make Energon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.46,0:40:45.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,声纳探测到六个敌人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prime sonar now holds six contacts...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.80,0:40:46.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,正快速靠近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and they're coming up fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.89,0:40:48.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,马上发碰撞警告...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man collisional arm...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.56,0:40:51.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...距离五百英尺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...are 500 feet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.80,0:40:52.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.86,0:40:53.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天使六号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Angel Six,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.62,0:40:55.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有六个敌人进犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we got six hostiles coming down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.13,0:41:04.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,准备撞击 侧翼...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Collision imminent. Portside...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.40,0:41:05.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,距离一百英尺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}100 feet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.28,0:41:06.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,准备撞击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brace for impact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.16,0:41:36.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,红蜘蛛 我回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Starscream, I'm home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.16,0:41:38.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,尊敬的威震天 看到您已恢复\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Behold, Megatron, I was so relieved{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.73,0:41:41.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就放心了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to hear of your...resurrection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.18,0:41:44.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你竟把我扔在垃圾星球上见死不救\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You left me to die, you pathetic insect!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.38,0:41:48.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是在扩充新的队伍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only to help spawn our new army,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.58,0:41:50.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,堕落金刚也很生气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Fallen decreased it,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.55,0:41:52.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,毕竟 您不在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}after all, in your absence,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.72,0:41:54.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总得有人来统领大局吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}someone had to take command.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.21,0:41:55.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.89,0:42:00.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 太让我失望了 - 小心 小心 别碰坏了小金刚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- are so disappointing. - Hatchlings Hatchlings... Careful fragile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.21,0:42:04.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,即便我死了 也轮不到别人发号施令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even in death, there's no command but mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.12,0:42:13.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的主人 此行我辜负了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My master, I failed you on Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.77,0:42:16.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,火种源被摧毁了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The All-Spark is destroyed,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.34,0:42:19.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有它 我们的种族迟早灭亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and without it, our race will perish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.23,0:42:23.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还有很多要学 我的傻徒弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have much to learn, my disciple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.27,0:42:25.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能量体只不过是个容器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Cube is merely a vessel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.90,0:42:29.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它的能量和真谛永不会被摧毁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's power, it's knowledge can never be destroyed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.62,0:42:32.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只不过变换了形态\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It can only transform.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.69,0:42:36.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这是怎么回事? - 能量体的能量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How is that possible? - It has been absorbed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.05,0:42:37.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,已被那男孩吸收\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by the human child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.95,0:42:40.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拯救我们的关键\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The key to saving our race...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.53,0:42:43.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就在他的大脑里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}now lies within his mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.15,0:42:44.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well then,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.20,0:42:46.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我把他的大脑生生给拿出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}let me strip the very flesh from his body.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.89,0:42:48.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会的 我的徒弟 迟早会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you will, my apprentice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.00,0:42:53.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,千年以来 我一直梦想能回到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In time. For millenia, I have dreamed of my return{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.89,0:42:56.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个被毁灭的星球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to that wretched planet,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.32,0:42:58.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那时我与汽车人还情同手足\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where I too was once betrayed,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.79,0:43:02.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可他们竟然背叛了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by the Primes I call my brothers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.31,0:43:06.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只有超级领袖才能打败我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only a Prime can defeat me,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.78,0:43:10.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是现在只剩一个超级领袖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and now only one remains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.26,0:43:13.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,擎天柱 是他在保护那个男孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Optimus. He protects the boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.00,0:43:17.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么这个男孩就可以带我们找到他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then the boy will lead us to him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.40,0:43:22.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这个仇我一定要报 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- and revenge will be ours. - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.81,0:43:25.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那男孩跑不掉的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The boy will not escape us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.87,0:43:27.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他一直在我们的监视下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have him in our sights.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.30,0:43:33.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是不补充能量的话 这些新生儿就会死掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Without more Energon, hatchlings will keep dying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.47,0:43:43.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,空间 时间 引力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Space, time, gravity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.89,0:43:49.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 谢谢 - 帮我吃完吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thank you. - Finish that for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.55,0:43:52.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天我和你们将要开始一段旅程\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going on a journey together, you and I, today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.85,0:43:55.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们正值青春年少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All you, eager nubile young minds...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.60,0:43:57.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,难怪精力过剩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on the very cusp of adulthood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.70,0:44:01.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是你们的伙伴 是向导 是灵魂伴侣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I shall be your consort, your guide,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.82,0:44:05.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我能发掘你们的阴暗面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your chaperone, into the heart of darkness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.36,0:44:10.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎听我的天文课\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to Astronomy 101.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.70,0:44:15.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们对星星的了解有多少?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For what do we know about the stars?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.76,0:44:19.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,处女座... 处女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Virgo... the virgin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.44,0:44:22.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,猎户座 也就是射手座\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Orion, the great hunter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.37,0:44:24.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可它们没有闪耀的钻石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are no mere twinkling diamonds{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.62,0:44:27.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,供纯情少女们日思夜想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for lovely maidens to wish upon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.07,0:44:31.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它们产生的能量规模大的惊人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, they are diamond, filled with a throbbing,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.44,0:44:34.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,随时要喷薄爆发出能量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}savage and hemped-up energy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.26,0:44:36.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来看看阿尔伯特·爱因斯坦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Behold the work of Albert Einstein,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.01,0:44:39.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那位曾和我一样的老教授的理论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a professor once, like moi,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.00,0:44:42.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 能量等于质量乘以... - 你在干什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- energy, in its mass temp... - What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.00,0:44:43.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把手放下 把手放下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put your hand down, put your hand down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.00,0:44:45.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,年轻人 上我的课\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Young man, there are no questions...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.51,0:44:47.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,到课堂高潮之时再提问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}until I've reached the climax of my lecture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.61,0:44:48.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我看完了你的书\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've just finished your book.{\r}
