Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.17,0:54:22.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们会...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They can....{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.03,0:54:27.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,停 停 停\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cut, cut, cut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.47,0:54:35.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 上帝!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.48,0:54:42.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亲这个吧 贱货\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kiss this, bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.58,0:54:49.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开走 开走 开走 开走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drive, drive, drive, drive, drive, drive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.23,0:54:54.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好 发生什么事了 好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, so what else's going right now, alright,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.66,0:54:56.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些外星人怎么回事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}did you guys just mess with the minor details?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.69,0:55:00.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,刚才你看到的 还算客气的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thing you saw back there. That was a little babe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.37,0:55:08.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇啊! 我的天哪! 我的天哪!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa! Oh my God! Oh my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.65,0:55:13.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,山姆!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.47,0:55:19.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 山姆! - 抓住了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sam! - Hold on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.08,0:55:20.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抓住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.28,0:55:24.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,山姆!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.93,0:55:29.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想死! 我们完蛋了! 哦 我的天!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want to die! We're going to die! Oh my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.08,0:55:56.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 老天! 哦 天!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Jesus! Oh, jeez!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.34,0:56:07.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,过来 小子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here, boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.35,0:56:09.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,近点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Closer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.15,0:56:11.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.66,0:56:14.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你记得我 对吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You remember me, don't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.30,0:56:15.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我照你说的做 好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did what you said, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.42,0:56:17.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 别伤害我们 - 闭嘴!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Just don't hurt us. - Shut up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.88,0:56:19.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,山姆!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.51,0:56:33.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,挖你的肉感觉真不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It feels good to grab your first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.13,0:56:39.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会让你慢慢痛苦地死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am going to kill you, slowly, painfully.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.97,0:56:44.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但首先我们有些细致的工作要做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But first, we have some delicate work to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.21,0:56:50.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真想把你的胳膊掰断\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could snap your ribs off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.73,0:56:54.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,医生 来检查一下这个外星物种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doctor, examine this alien specimen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.70,0:56:58.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会扫描你 让我看看你的脸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll scan you. Let's take a look at your face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.50,0:57:06.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是医生 我要情报 交出碎片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm the doctor. The odd job Information. Beseeching my shard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.41,0:57:19.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来软的还是硬的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Easy or tough way?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.82,0:57:21.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去那边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go that way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.66,0:57:31.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,讨厌的虫子...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A wormy that's crabby...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.87,0:57:45.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 就是这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, there they are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.14,0:57:46.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我脑子里的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what I'm seeing in my head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.44,0:57:49.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些符号能指引我们找到能量源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These symbols can lead us to the Energon source.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.42,0:57:52.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须得到大脑!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must have the brain!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.60,0:57:54.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放到这桌上 快!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the table, faster!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.34,0:57:58.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大脑? 你们要我大脑干什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brain? What does he mean by my brain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.31,0:58:00.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,呃 你脑子里有点东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you have something on your mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.43,0:58:01.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我需要的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something I need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.60,0:58:02.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等 我知道你生气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on. I know you're pissed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.80,0:58:03.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你生气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you're pissed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.51,0:58:04.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你生气是因为我想杀你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I tried to kill you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.50,0:58:05.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这绝对是个误会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and it's completely understandable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.50,0:58:06.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有人想杀我的话 我也会郁闷的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody tried to kill me, I'd be upset too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.02,0:58:09.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我认为完全有机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think that we have an opportunity here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.55,0:58:12.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,重新开始... 改善我们的关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to start a new and...and develop our relationship,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.86,0:58:15.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后 咱们携手共建和谐社会 好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and...and, see where it leads us, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.19,0:58:16.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就把医生叫回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you just call doctor inspection,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.44,0:58:18.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,5秒钟后我会让你说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll let you talk in five seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.40,0:58:19.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等...等...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}W...Wait...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.76,0:58:26.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走 走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.82,0:58:31.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走 走 走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, go, go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.74,0:58:59.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,山姆!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.24,0:59:17.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走 走 走 走!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, go, go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.14,0:59:19.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他来了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here he comes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.54,0:59:29.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,藏起来 山姆! 藏起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hide, Sam! Hide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.34,0:59:39.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,懦夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Weak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.91,0:59:42.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Puny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.44,0:59:45.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,废铁一堆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Waste of metal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.73,0:59:51.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,废物 败类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Junkyard drone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.35,0:59:54.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,霸天虎!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Decepticons!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.90,1:00:06.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,过来 小子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here, boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.50,1:00:40.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有一个能量源...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is another source of Energon...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.60,1:00:41.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,藏在这个星球上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}hidden on this planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.97,1:00:44.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这孩子可以带我们找到它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The boy can lead us to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.50,1:01:01.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,擎天柱!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Optimus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.40,1:01:17.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,难道我们种族的未来...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is the future of our race...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.83,1:01:20.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还不如一个人类的生命重要吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not worth a single human life?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.91,1:01:22.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,擎天柱 起来!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Op, get up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.33,1:01:24.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你杀人成瘾了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll never stop at one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.09,1:01:28.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我绝不会放过你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take you all alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.87,1:02:12.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,薄铁皮一张!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Piece of tin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.20,1:02:16.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,山姆 你在哪儿?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam, where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.25,1:02:23.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你太差劲了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are so weak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.50,1:02:55.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,终于 超级领袖都死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At last, Prime is dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.63,1:03:05.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,山姆 快跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam, run.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.49,1:03:20.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,汽车人 进攻!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Autobots, attack!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.96,1:03:26.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大黄蜂 快带他们离开这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bumblebee, get them out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.44,1:03:41.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是伦诺克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Lennox.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.38,1:03:55.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,干得不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That went well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.50,1:03:58.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主人 那孩子跟丢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lost the boy, Master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.10,1:04:00.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,汽车人把信号都隐蔽了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Autobots must be shielding the signals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.00,1:04:03.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你说我能靠你做点啥 - 对不起 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I can't even rely on you. - Sorry. No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.34,1:04:05.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个小小的昆虫而已!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a simple insect!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.76,1:04:07.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,七十亿人找一个...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What insect amongst severed billion...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.80,1:04:08.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.03,1:04:12.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大海捞针啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It could be anywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.37,1:04:16.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就强迫所有的人类来帮我们找\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then we will force them to find him for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.18,1:04:20.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该让全世界知道我们的存在了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's time for the world to know of our presence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.44,1:04:23.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不再遮遮掩掩 不再手下留情!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No more disguises, no mercy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.97,1:04:27.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该轮到我的主人出场了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time has come for my master's arrival.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.67,1:04:35.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,霸天虎 出发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Decepticons, mobilise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.16,1:04:37.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,时候到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.74,1:04:54.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 单身就这点好!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, that single's good!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.48,1:04:56.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说法语真让人兴奋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Speaking French is so exciting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.80,1:04:58.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 我的天 这是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh God, who is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.61,1:05:03.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好...我是说 呃 下午好!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello...I mean, uh, bon...bonswa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.78,1:05:06.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么? 你谁呀?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? Who is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.13,1:05:09.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 想气死我呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, for Pete's sakes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.83,1:05:10.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可不欣赏...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not impressed with...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.80,1:05:12.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在电话里瞎喘气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your perverted mouth breathing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.14,1:05:16.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(纽约市)
