Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.87,1:16:01.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听说过真实的世界.com吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You never heard of TheRealEffingDeal.com?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.16,1:16:03.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是那个超级白痴的博客网站\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must be talking about that amateur blog{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.70,1:16:06.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它的防火墙形同虚设\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}operation with GameBoy level security.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.20,1:16:07.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,机器战士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Robo-Warrior.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.20,1:16:10.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是他 就是他! 就是这家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's him. It's him! That's the guy right there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.28,1:16:11.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.28,1:16:13.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.24,1:16:15.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开玩笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta be kidding me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.28,1:16:17.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,各位 本店打烊了 全部出去!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright, meat store's closed. Everybody out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.78,1:16:18.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,出去 现在!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, right now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.46,1:16:20.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说你呢 女士 快出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That means you, lady, right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.65,1:16:22.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等下 你认识这个人吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute, you know this guy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.07,1:16:23.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们是老相识了 - 哇啊 老相识\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We're old friends. - Whoa, friend,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.61,1:16:26.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就因为你 第七区撤消了编制\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you are the case that shut down Sector 7.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.28,1:16:27.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,全员遣散回老家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got the tie-bash disbandment,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.86,1:16:29.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有风光的工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}no more security clearance,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.50,1:16:31.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有退休金 一无所有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}no retirement, no nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.19,1:16:32.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,全都因为你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All 'cause of you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.73,1:16:34.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有和你相好的少女罪犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and your little criminal girlfriend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.28,1:16:35.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看她 辣妹一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at her now, so mature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.82,1:16:38.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,白痴 鳟鱼在哪儿?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moron, where's the wifresh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.65,1:16:40.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别让我碰到那些肉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't catch me with the thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.65,1:16:41.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 亚科夫! - 干嘛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yakov! - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.15,1:16:44.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再傻站着年终奖金取消\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't get Christmas bonus just standing around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.36,1:16:46.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还想攒钱镶新牙吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want those new teeth you saw in SkyMall?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.44,1:16:48.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 当然了 - 那去帮帮她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's my dream. - Help around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.15,1:16:50.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你和妈妈一起住吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You live with your momma?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.06,1:16:50.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 是妈妈和我住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, my momma lives with me,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.02,1:16:51.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是两回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's a big difference.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.65,1:16:53.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,电视上全是你的照片 外星仔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They got your face all over the news, alien boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.61,1:16:55.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 好 我知道 - 那威震天还活着啊?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, I know. - And NBE-1, still kicking, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.02,1:16:57.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是怎么回事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did that happen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.27,1:16:59.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别回答 我不知道你的秘密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't answer.I don't know what you're hiding,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.40,1:17:00.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也不想有任何瓜葛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I don't want anything to do with it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.69,1:17:01.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么 再见 只当你没见过我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so, goodbye, you never saw me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.85,1:17:03.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还要做事 赶紧消失\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got bagels to schmidt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.36,1:17:04.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给我五秒钟时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, give me 5 seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.73,1:17:06.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 等等 我需要你帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, hold on, I need your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.27,1:17:08.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的 你要我帮忙?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really, you need my help?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.98,1:17:09.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.86,1:17:12.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 我差点掉了脑袋 明白吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I am slowly losing my mind, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.23,1:17:14.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那机器人医生把设备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had a little Crabbot, placed the device{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.06,1:17:15.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,植入我大脑软组织\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}deep into the soft tissues of my brain,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.65,1:17:17.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,像家庭影院一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and started projecting little alien symbols{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.35,1:17:18.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放映出外星语符号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}like a whole freaking movie{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.35,1:17:20.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且我还是个逃犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and on top of that, I'm a wanted fugitive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.15,1:17:21.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你能理解吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you think you got it rough?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.27,1:17:23.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你脑子里的图像被投射出来?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said it projected images of your brain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.48,1:17:24.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.89,1:17:26.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,冷冻室 快!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Meat locker, now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.85,1:17:28.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 速冻肉 - 真恶心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dead pigs. - Yuck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.10,1:17:30.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们将看到的是最高机密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you're about to see is top secret.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.02,1:17:32.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,千万别告诉我妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not tell my mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.80,1:17:35.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是死猪 会得病的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dead pigs, swine flu.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.00,1:17:36.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不好 - 现在你知道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Not good. - Now you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.39,1:17:38.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,下次吃肉的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Next time, you eat a goat or a pig.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.10,1:17:39.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想想背后的故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a story behind this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.39,1:17:40.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,糟糕的真相\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sad little story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.14,1:17:42.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...你说你相信有外星人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you're saying you believe in aliens?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.02,1:17:44.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 资料 资料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, files, files.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.52,1:17:46.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们谈的是符号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're talking about symbols.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.85,1:17:49.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿! 还有放射性 别碰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Still radioactive. Hands off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.39,1:17:51.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 小脑瓜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay,  Cube-brain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.85,1:17:54.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看到的是这些符号吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any of these look like the symbols you saw?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.14,1:17:56.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你哪儿弄的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where did you get these?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.56,1:17:58.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我被解雇之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Before I got fired.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.14,1:18:00.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从第七区弄到的独家资料...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I coached S-7's scrawny, drooly...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.72,1:18:03.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,历时七十五年的外星人研究\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}75 years of alien research...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.24,1:18:05.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,指出了一个不容回避的事实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which points to one inescapable fact:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.76,1:18:07.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,变形金刚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Transformers...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.07,1:18:10.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很久以前就来过地球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they've been here a long, long time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.39,1:18:11.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要证据吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do I know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.43,1:18:14.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,考古学家在世界各地的名胜古迹中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Archaeologists found these unexplained markings{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.43,1:18:16.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,发现了这些标记\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and ancient runes all over the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.22,1:18:19.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,中国 埃及 希腊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}China, Egypt, Greece.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.05,1:18:21.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,1932年拍的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shot at 1932.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.85,1:18:23.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些符号见过吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These the symbols you're seeing in your head?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.72,1:18:26.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 对 - 一模一样 是吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. - Same ones over here, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.72,1:18:28.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么 告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, tell me,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.00,1:18:30.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁会留下一样的图案呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}how did they end up all drawing the same thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.26,1:18:33.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,外星人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aliens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.68,1:18:35.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且我觉得有些人就没离开过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I think some of them stayed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.39,1:18:36.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check this out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.47,1:18:38.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,黑刃计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Project Black Knife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.72,1:18:42.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伪装的机器人一直潜伏在地球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Robots, in disguise. Hiding here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.72,1:18:43.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一直以来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All along.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.43,1:18:45.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在全国范围内...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We detected radioactive signatures...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.20,1:18:46.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,均检测到放射性物质\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}all across the country.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.76,1:18:50.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我甚至下跪求第七区对此调查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I pleaded on my knees with S-7 to investigate it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.22,1:18:53.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但他们说读数少得可以忽略\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but they said the readings were infantesimal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.84,1:18:56.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还说我是在做梦!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That I was obsessed!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.59,1:18:58.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我 你能相信吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me, can you imagine that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.21,1:19:00.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,威震天说这儿...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Megatron said that there...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.20,1:19:01.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有个能量源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was another Energon source here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.59,1:19:02.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 地球上? - 地球上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- On Earth? - On Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.46,1:19:03.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,另一个能量源?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On another source?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.55,1:19:04.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 还有个能量源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, and that these symbols,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.63,1:19:06.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且我这里的符号地图能够指路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the maps in my head would lead him there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.46,1:19:08.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你和汽车人说了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Should you talk to your Autobot friends?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.21,1:19:09.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有 没有 他们是后来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no, the source is before.{\r}
