Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.85,1:28:05.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 都还好吗? - 都好!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You guys okay? - Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.51,1:28:08.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿! 到拉斯维加斯了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! I think we're in Vegas!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.43,1:28:09.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的 真的很疼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That really, really hurts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.97,1:28:12.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你很走运 我没伤着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're just lucky that I didn't get hurt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.18,1:28:13.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样是要死人的 知道吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People could've gotten killed, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.55,1:28:14.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要是伤着了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if I would have gotten hurt,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.76,1:28:16.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我老妈会问候你... - 哦 闭嘴!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- you would have heard from... - Oh, shut up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.97,1:28:18.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说了要架个时空桥梁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you I was opening the space bridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.76,1:28:21.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样到埃及才会快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the fastest way to travel to Egypt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.01,1:28:23.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在说什么? 你什么都没跟我们讲!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you tell us? You didn't tell us anything!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.93,1:28:26.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你什么都不说 还来埃及干吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't tell us anything. Why are we in Egypt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.10,1:28:28.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还敢对我那么没礼貌 小混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you dare slip in with me, fleshwing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.30,1:28:30.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我原来告诉你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You would do the informed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.49,1:28:31.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能听我说两句吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you just stop for a second?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.72,1:28:33.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听得清吧? 你说说为什么来埃及\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you focus? Can you tell us why we're in Egypt{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.68,1:28:35.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,至少得让我们...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so we can all have a little bit...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.01,1:28:36.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都有点心理准备吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}assemblance and peace of mind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.34,1:28:39.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个星球我们机器人以前就来过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This planet was visited by our race once before{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.64,1:28:42.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,第一代祖先百万年前就来过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by our earliest ancestors a millenium ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.59,1:28:44.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们的使命是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were on an exploratory mission...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.60,1:28:45.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,收集能量块\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to harvest Energon,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.79,1:28:48.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是机器人的生命之源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the life blood of our race.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.42,1:28:52.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有它我们会腐烂 氧化 生锈 就像我这身架子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Without it, we'll all perish, oxidize and rust,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.38,1:28:55.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们知道慢慢腐朽而死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have any idea what is...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.00,1:28:57.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有多痛苦啊?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}like a slowly fall of parton die?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.62,1:29:00.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你别总跑题行吗? 老先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's not get episodic, okay? Old-timer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.92,1:29:03.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从头到尾简单说出事实和细节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beginning, middle, end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.00,1:29:06.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把来龙去脉说清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Facts, details, condense, plot, tell it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.33,1:29:08.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在沙漠的某一处地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somewhere buried in this desert,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.70,1:29:11.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的祖先建了个巨型机器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}our ancestors built a great machine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.50,1:29:15.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,通过摧毁恒星来获得能量块\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It harvests Energon by destroying suns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.71,1:29:17.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 摧毁恒星? - 把太阳炸掉?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Destroy suns? - You mean blow them up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.46,1:29:19.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对 你看 开始的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. You see, in the beginning,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.50,1:29:21.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,曾经有七位超级领袖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there were seven Primes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.16,1:29:22.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都是第一批领袖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}our original leaders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.87,1:29:24.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们进入宇宙...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And they set out in the Universe...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.70,1:29:26.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,寻找其它星系的恒星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}seeking distant suns to harvest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.41,1:29:29.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些超级领袖有一个原则:\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Primes set out with one rule:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.70,1:29:32.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,决不摧毁有生命的星球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never destroy a planet with life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.87,1:29:35.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但后来有一位违背了这项原则\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Until one of them tried to defy this rule.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.99,1:29:40.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他的名字就是“堕落金刚”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And his name, for ever more, was the Fallen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.91,1:29:44.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他不顾人类死活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He despised the human race.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.41,1:29:47.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想启动那个机器...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he wanted to kill you all...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.45,1:29:49.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来消灭人类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by turning on that machine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.49,1:29:53.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而激活它的唯一途径就是传说中的钥匙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only way to activate it is with a legendary key{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.91,1:29:57.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也就是我们所说的领导模块\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}called the Matrix of Leadership.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.32,1:30:05.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,领导模块的归属问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A great battle took place...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.50,1:30:07.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,引发了一场鏖战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}over possession of the Matrix.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.20,1:30:14.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,堕落金刚比其他超级领袖更强大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Fallen who was stronger at his will did,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.90,1:30:17.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其他超级领袖只能...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}surrendered no choice,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.60,1:30:20.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,偷出领导模块藏起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but to steal and hide it from him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.41,1:30:23.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们做了最后的牺牲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the ultimate sacrifice,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.50,1:30:26.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以生命为代价将领导模块封藏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they gave their lives to seal the Matrix away{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.28,1:30:29.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,藏于用他们遗体铸成的坟墓里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in a tomb made of their very own bodies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.20,1:30:33.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这座墓没有人知道在哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A tomb we cannot find.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.49,1:30:37.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就在这沙漠某处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somewhere, buried in this desert,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.40,1:30:40.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,埋藏着那台特别的机器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that deadly machine remains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.07,1:30:42.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,堕落金刚知道位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Fallen knows where it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.28,1:30:45.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果他找到了超级领袖的墓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if he finds the Tomb of the Primes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.20,1:30:48.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们的世界将不复存在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your world will be no more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.40,1:30:49.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那怎么阻止他?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay so how do we stop it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.94,1:30:52.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只有超级领袖能打败堕落金刚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only a Prime can defeat the Fallen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.65,1:30:53.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比如擎天柱?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Optimus Prime?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.52,1:30:58.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你遇到过超级领袖吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you met a Prime?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.23,1:31:01.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你遇到的肯定是超级领袖的后代\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must have met a great descendant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.82,1:31:02.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他还活着吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is he alive?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.98,1:31:05.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在这个星球上吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here? On this planet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.61,1:31:07.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他为了救我牺牲了自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He sacrificed himself to save me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.61,1:31:09.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么他死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So he's dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.02,1:31:11.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有超级领袖就完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Without a Prime, it's impossible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.19,1:31:14.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没人能阻止堕落金刚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one else could stop the Fallen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.36,1:31:15.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个能量若能...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So the same energy that's going to be...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.92,1:31:17.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,重启那台机器...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}used to reactivate the machine...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.23,1:31:19.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那它能用来...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could that energy somehow be...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.90,1:31:21.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,激活擎天柱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}used to reactivate Optimus...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.23,1:31:22.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让他重获新生吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and bring him back to life?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.23,1:31:24.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,设计之初并没这么考虑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was never designed for that purpose,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.27,1:31:26.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但这种力量非比寻常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but it's an energy, like no other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.19,1:31:29.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在霸天虎抓到我之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So then how do you get us to the Matrix{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.40,1:31:31.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么带我们找到领导模块?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before the Decepticons get to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.14,1:31:34.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,用你的脑子 地图 符号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Follow your mind, your map, your symbols,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.48,1:31:37.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在地上写的 都是线索\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what you got in the sand, it's your bloom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.06,1:31:39.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,曙光照耀在匕首之尖的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When dawn alights the Dagger's tip,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.39,1:31:42.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,三位国王将打开入口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}three kings will reveal the doorway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.19,1:31:44.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,找到那入口!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find the doorway!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.35,1:31:45.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快去!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go now, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.10,1:31:49.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这曾是我的使命 现在是你的使命了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was my mission. It's your mission now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.10,1:31:51.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要在霸天虎找到你我之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go before the Decepticons find me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.72,1:31:53.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,先找到入口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and find you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.97,1:32:01.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,中情局我有个线人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was my CIA contact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.39,1:32:03.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说古代苏美尔人称亚喀巴海湾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Says Ancient Sumerian used to call the Gulf of Aqaba{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.85,1:32:06.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 为匕首之尖 - 那是匕首之尖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- the Dagger's Tip. - That's the dagger's tip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.10,1:32:07.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 它是红海的一部分 - 明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's part of the Red Sea. - Got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.26,1:32:09.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一刀为二分出埃及和约旦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It divides Egypt and Jordan like the tip of a blade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.52,1:32:12.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,北纬29.5度 东经35度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}29 and a half degrees north.35 east.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.60,1:32:13.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.60,1:32:14.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 首先得把...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, first thing we gotta do...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.70,1:32:15.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,擎天柱给弄过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is get Optimus to Dagger's Tip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.85,1:32:16.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么带着他...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How are you gonna get him...{\r}
