Dialogue: 0,1:49:28.70,1:49:32.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,寸草不生的埃及沙漠里联系到我们?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from some random Egyptian desert?{\r}
