Dialogue: 0,1:49:43.23,1:49:45.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,准备气罐 多放点烟 好让那个孩子找到我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pop some more flares so that the kid can find us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:52.77,1:49:54.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看 就是那儿 我们快到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look. There he is. We got a couple of miles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:55.36,1:49:59.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伦诺克斯的队伍拥有最先进的量子通讯器材\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lennox's team has the latest in quantum crypto gear.{\r}
