Dialogue: 0,1:51:01.27,1:51:04.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 一个...老光棍... - 别再说了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- One man... alone... - Stop saying that.{\r}
