Dialogue: 0,1:52:20.00,1:52:21.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 有多少? - 大概十三个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How many? - We got 13 to count.{\r}
