Dialogue: 0,1:53:59.01,1:54:00.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 准备好 - 老天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hit the deck! - Oh, my God!{\r}
