Dialogue: 0,2:11:40.59,2:11:41.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, why is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:41.93,2:11:43.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉他们橘红色烟雾为打击目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told them to hit the orange smoke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:45.38,2:11:46.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是说橘红色的烟雾吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean that orange smoke?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:47.05,2:11:48.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我这次没扔准 不行吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It wasn't my best toss, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:50.51,2:11:52.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 快跑! - 快跑!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Run! - Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:00.51,2:12:02.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来啦!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Incoming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:05.17,2:12:05.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:39.88,2:12:40.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,死吧!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Die!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:47.79,2:12:49.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,山姆!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:05.20,2:13:07.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别开火!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold your fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:09.25,2:13:09.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,山姆!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:11.95,2:13:14.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走开! 快去叫救护车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out! Get me an EVAC.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:16.29,2:13:18.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快想想办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fucking do something!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:53.57,2:13:55.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 山姆! 山姆... - 山姆!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sam! Sam... - Sam!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:02.32,2:14:04.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快点 我们走 我们走 快点!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, we got to move. We got to move! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:07.80,2:14:09.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要看看我孩子 那是我儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to see my kid. I got a son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:09.95,2:14:10.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,山姆!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sammy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:14.74,2:14:18.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,准备! 电击 准备! 电击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clear! Take a shot. Clear! Take a shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:18.28,2:14:19.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一 二 三\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One, two, three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:22.57,2:14:23.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别再这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do it again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:29.03,2:14:30.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,山姆!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:32.69,2:14:37.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 听我的声音 我爱你 我需要你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, listen to my voice. I love you and I need you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:38.69,2:14:44.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托 拜托 为了我回来 山姆 拜托! 我爱你!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, please come back to me. Sam, please! I love you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:55.81,2:14:57.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我死了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Am I dead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:58.44,2:15:02.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们一直在关注你 很长很长时间了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have been watching you. A long, long time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:05.02,2:15:07.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为擎天柱而战斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have fought for Optimus,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:07.27,2:15:11.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们唯一的后代 你英勇无畏 不怕牺牲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}our last descendant, with courage and with sacrifice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:11.77,2:15:14.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,具有领袖精神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The virtues of a leader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:14.85,2:15:17.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们值得将秘密托付给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A leader worthy of our secret.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:18.27,2:15:21.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,领导模块不是被发现的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Matrix of Leadership is not found.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:21.73,2:15:23.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而是努力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is earned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:24.23,2:15:26.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,回到擎天柱身边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Return now to Optimus,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:27.14,2:15:29.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,将领导模块融合到他的火种源中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}merge the Matrix with his Spark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:30.06,2:15:34.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是你此生注定的命运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is, and always has been, your destiny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:39.56,2:15:40.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,山姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:46.93,2:15:48.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:27.13,2:16:30.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,孩子 你为我而回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boy, you returned for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:31.51,2:16:33.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,活着的领导者!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A living Prime!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:35.05,2:16:37.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,简直不敢相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't believe it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:47.67,2:16:50.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,领导模块是我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My Matrix.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:55.55,2:16:56.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,站起来 站起来 站起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get up, get up, get up, get up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:58.05,2:16:59.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,站起来 擎天柱!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get up, Prime!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:01.13,2:17:04.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 哦 不 - 他要启动机器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, no. - He's turned on the machine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:05.42,2:17:07.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要阻止他 站起来!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta stop him. Get up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:07.46,2:17:09.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,擎天柱!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Optimus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:11.13,2:17:13.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,堕落金刚 我的主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fallen, my master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:13.75,2:17:18.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的那些兄弟们这次可挡不了我的道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My brothers could not stop me from this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:19.09,2:17:23.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 对 - 现在 太阳是我的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes. - Now I claim your sun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:26.50,2:17:28.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,向金字塔顶射击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enemy target, top of pyramid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:28.21,2:17:30.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,行动 行动 行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Engage, engage, engage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:35.71,2:17:38.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很快 我们的力量会更强大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In moments, we'll be at siren strength.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:54.45,2:17:58.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我这辈子没干过什么有意义的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All my Decepticon life I never did a thing worth doing until now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:59.58,2:18:02.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,擎天柱 收下我的礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Optimus, take my parts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:02.58,2:18:05.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这能量之强大 你无法预料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you'll have a power you've never known.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:06.41,2:18:08.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请完成你的使命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fulfill your destiny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:14.62,2:18:16.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,汽车人 通电!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jolt, electrify!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:17.17,2:18:19.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,移植加力燃烧器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Transplant those afterburners.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:37.45,2:18:39.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,出击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's roll.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:41.57,2:18:43.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开火 瞄准金字塔!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire. Take it off to the pyramid!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:55.49,2:18:59.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个星球将永远陷入黑暗中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This planet will be dark forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:21.49,2:19:23.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和你的兄弟们一样去死吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Die like your brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:24.36,2:19:26.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们也是你的兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were your brothers too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:55.31,2:19:57.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,红蜘蛛...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Starscream...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:10.48,2:20:12.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你选错目标了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You picked the wrong planet!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:15.48,2:20:17.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拿下你的面罩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me your face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:25.98,2:20:30.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,成王败寇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I rise. You fall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:32.18,2:20:35.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:36.89,2:20:41.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想劝你做胆小鬼 主人 但有时侯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not to call you a coward, Master, but sometimes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:41.60,2:20:45.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,胆小鬼往往能生存下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}cowards do survive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:45.89,2:20:47.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这不算完\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isn't over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:15.26,2:21:18.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,经历了这一切你才愿意说你爱我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You took all of this for you to tell me that you love me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:19.80,2:21:21.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你先说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said it first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:12.71,2:22:15.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 山姆 你救了我的命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Sam, for saving my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:16.59,2:22:17.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别客气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:18.63,2:22:20.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你信任我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you for believing in me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:25.08,2:22:29.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的种族因为被遗忘的过去而走到一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our races united by a history long forgotten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:29.75,2:22:33.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,齐心协力面对未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And a future we shall face together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:33.75,2:22:38.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是擎天柱 在此发出倡议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am Optimus Prime, and I send this message{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:38.08,2:22:41.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让这段历史流传下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so that our past will always be remembered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:41.29,2:22:46.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们拥有珍贵的记忆 生生不息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For in those memories, we live on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:23:08.10,2:23:11.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴你能来听课 爱因斯坦教授\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So glad you can join us, Professoer Einstein.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:23:12.02,2:23:13.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对 最近有点忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah it's kink of busy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:23:16.12,2:23:17.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
